# basePath DesignCh5Basic
// Depletion

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL}  Gates can switch semiconductor in their space. With a HI signal, they make P-Type act like N-Type.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  <color=yellow>Hint:</color> When A is HI, block signal from reaching the output.
    $set temp:hintGiven = 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  <color=yellow>Hint:</color> Input A should control the Gate.
    $set temp:hintGiven = 0
$endif